   "fieldname": "enabled",
   "fieldtype": "Check",
   "label": "Enabled",
   "default": "0",
   "description": "Turns on reference resolution, the outbox and the IDoc receiver. Postings from FoaMES create documents in S/4HANA that SAP may count under Digital Access licensing; check the customer's SAP contract."
  },
  {
